---
# Everything at its defaults, for the occasional sweep: run
# Tools/quality/clang-tidy.ps1 -Full. Nothing here is expected to be at zero.
#
# The point of keeping it is that .clang-tidy turns three checks off and tunes
# two others, and a suppression nobody ever looks behind is how a real report
# goes missing. This is the way to look behind it without editing anything.
Checks: '-*,clang-diagnostic-*,bugprone-*,performance-*,misc-include-cleaner'
WarningsAsErrors: ''
HeaderFilterRegex: '.*[/\](src|prototype)[/\].*'
...
